  "title": "First BanCorp. Announces Earnings for the Quarter and Year Ended December 31, 2025",
  "summary": "First BanCorp. (the “Corporation” or “First BanCorp.”) (NYSE: FBP), the bank holding company for FirstBank Puerto Rico (“FirstBank” or “the Bank”), today reported a net income of $87.1 million, or $0.55 per diluted share, for the fourth quarter of 2025, compared to $100.5 million, or $0.63 per diluted share, for the third quarter of 2025, and $75.7 million, or $0.46 per diluted share, for the fourth quarter of 2024. For the year ended December 31, 2025, the Corporation reported a net income of $",
